Stage 0 — Foundation (প্রায় শেষ, maintain করো)
 Math basics — GCD/LCM, modular arithmetic
 Number theory — sieve, linear sieve, segmented sieve, Euler's totient
 STL — vector, stack, queue, priority_queue, map, set
 Two pointers
 Sliding window
Stage 1 — Next Priority (এখনই শুরু করার মতো)
Recursion + Backtracking — চলছে, DP তে যাওয়ার আগে শেষ করো
Binary Search (+ binary search on answer) — CF তে heavy weight, two pointers এর related
Prefix sum / Difference array — ছোট কিন্তু foundational, দ্রুত শেখা যায়
Stage 2 — Core Middle Tier
Graph — BFS / DFS — চলছে, continue করো
Bit manipulation — bitwise ops, XOR tricks, popcount, subset enumeration
Basic DP — 1D DP (Fibonacci, climbing stairs), knapsack, LIS
Stage 3 — Intermediate
Graph — Dijkstra (shortest path)
Union-Find / DSU
Topological sort
DP on graphs / trees
Bitmask DP (TSP-style, N ≤ 20)
Segment tree / Fenwick tree (BIT)
Stage 4 — Advanced (৬ মাস+ পরে)
Advanced graph — MST, SCC, max flow
String algorithms — KMP, Z-function, hashing
Advanced DP — digit DP, DP optimization (bitset, CHT, etc.)
Advanced number theory — extended Euclid, CRT, matrix exponentiation
